sequenceDiagram
  participant View as CopilotView
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Flow as workflow.py
  participant MCP as MCP stdio
  participant Data as restaurants.json
  View->>View: followUpContext from cards already shown
  View->>API: query, user_id, session_id, context
  API->>Flow: run_agent_workflow
  Flow->>Flow: intent JSON, then parser lock
  Note over Flow: missing area becomes Old Klang Road
  Flow->>MCP: search_restaurants
  MCP->>Data: hard filter, then BM25 or baseline
  Data-->>MCP: canonical rows
  MCP-->>Flow: ids and card fields
  opt reviews requested and a unique name matches
    Flow->>MCP: get_restaurant_reviews
  end
  Flow->>Flow: reorder retrieved ids only
  Flow->>Flow: synthesis, or a labeled fallback
  Flow-->>API: message, results, trace
  API-->>View: ChatResponse
  View->>View: prose, map pins, cards
